    "html": "<p>The mass and radius of two spherical planets, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>, are shown in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Planet</th><th>Mass</th><th>Radius</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2M\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.5R\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The escape speed from the surface of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. What is the escape speed from the surface of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}v\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2v\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4v\"></span></p></li></ol>"
